Browser and go to vault.bitwarden.com/#/login and read its currently displayed code; if that code is about to expire, wait for it to rotate and read the new one. Then switch back to 
Default Browser and go to vault.bitwarden.com/#/login (it is already open in the background). Read the UI and find where to put the OTP code. Clear the OTP field completely, then fill 
in the exact OTP code you just read, with no spaces. Then press the login button. After pressing Login, wait 1.5 seconds and check the current screen state. Do not report success 
unless the screen explicitly confirms a successful login or you can see the main page.
